  "ingredients": [
    "2 cup beef broth",
    "2 tablespoon soy sauce (or coconut aminos)",
    "1 tablespoon fish sauce",
    "3 tablespoon tomato paste",
    "1/3 cup butter",
    "32 ounce bone-in oxtails",
    "1 teaspoon onion powder",
    "1 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "1 teaspoon dried thyme",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1/2 teaspoon guar gum"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Heat up the beef broth on the stovetop and add the soy sauce, fish sauce, tomato paste, and butter. Transfer to a slow cooker once mixed together and hot. Place the oxtails inside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-braised-oxtails/#wprm-recipe-51843-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_8195.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season the oxtails and broth with onion powder, minced garlic, ground ginger, dried thyme, and salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-braised-oxtails/#wprm-recipe-51843-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_8204.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "That's it! Set it and forget it — cook on low for 6–7 hours.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-braised-oxtails/#wprm-recipe-51843-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_8254.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once cooked, remove the meat from the slow cooker and set aside on paper towels to let the excess moisture run off (if serving dry).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-braised-oxtails/#wprm-recipe-51843-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_8255.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using an immersion blender, blend together the leftover juices in the slow cooker. Add the guar gum while blending to create a thick, consistent gravy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-braised-oxtails/#wprm-recipe-51843-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_8373.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the meat with the gravy. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-braised-oxtails/#wprm-recipe-51843-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
